Error [E0745]: `calc` is `@Pure` but also declares effects
  --> tests/ui/effect_pure_contradiction.jet:1:10
    |
  1 | @Pure fn calc() #(Fs) -> Int {
    |          ^^^^
 Why: `@Pure` means the empty effect set; a `#(…)` list on the same function asks for both empty and non-empty
 Fix: drop the `#(…)` list to keep `calc` pure, or remove `@Pure`
